{"2321430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kingdom Heroes M", "steam_appid": 2321430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "《三國群英傳M》以忠實還原《三國群英傳Online》為目標，掌握原始美術風格、職業、打寶吃王、武魂、國戰等核心玩法，讓老玩家能隨時隨地重懷過往三國旅程。<br><br>【遊戲特色】<br>■ 延續三國經典喚回你的熱血感動<br>超過百張地圖還原線上遊戲世界，知名歷史武魂再現三國群英，經典橫向捲軸玩法，體驗的不只是最初的回憶，還有熱血與感動。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/2ab8bdb01c2fd38d4869a25ac44ab6b5.poster.avif?t=1784707314\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/2ab8bdb01c2fd38d4869a25ac44ab6b5.webm?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/2ab8bdb01c2fd38d4869a25ac44ab6b5.mp4?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■ 暢玩三群一手掌握<br>跨世代操作，打破電腦設備和環境等因素，實現全民皆兵的目標。<br><br>■ 千軍萬馬盡在掌中<br>養成專屬自己的士兵護衛，透過不同的兵種配置應付不同的戰況，玩法變化多元，超越遊戲的特別體驗<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c06a96f3d70185f9d838935550bc1a65.poster.avif?t=1784707314\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c06a96f3d70185f9d838935550bc1a65.webm?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c06a96f3d70185f9d838935550bc1a65.mp4?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■ 全區指揮熱血參戰<br>「指揮系統」全區掌控，不需要語音和打字溝通即可讓軍團長快速掌握戰局，決戰千里之外。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c7844ce53bac451566b8039432bf0627.poster.avif?t=1784707314\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c7844ce53bac451566b8039432bf0627.webm?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/c7844ce53bac451566b8039432bf0627.mp4?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■ 自動掛機線上競標<br>超高自由度的競標系統，體現自給自足的自由經濟；最完善的掛機功能，享受最佳「打寶」樂趣。<br><br>■ 百煉戰甲神兵鍛造<br>解放裝備限制，簡化強化需求，只要有心，每件裝備都會成為神之兵器。<br><br>■ 武魂重現萬人國戰<br>化身三國名將，小卒也能成英雄；實現萬人國戰，打造國戰最佳體驗。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/b26558c59556f76b3edef6132b188e4f.poster.avif?t=1784707314\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/b26558c59556f76b3edef6132b188e4f.webm?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/b26558c59556f76b3edef6132b188e4f.mp4?t=1784707314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>■ 三國名將盡在指間<br>化身三國名將，與同伴一起征戰沙場，親臨古戰場，感受名場面<br><br>※ 依遊戲軟體分級管理辦法分類為輔15級。遊戲情節涉及暴力、菸酒、性(輕微裸露)。<br>※ 您須年滿15歲始得使用本遊戲。<br>※ 請注意遊戲時間，避免沉迷於遊戲，可能影響身心健康。<br>※ 本遊戲為免費使用，遊戲內另提供購買虛擬遊戲幣、物品等付費服務。<br>※ 勿用他人代儲以免觸法。<br>©USERJOY Technology Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.", "about_the_game": "《三國群英傳M》以忠實還原《三國群英傳Online》為目標，掌握原始美術風格、職業、打寶吃王、武魂、國戰等核心玩法，讓老玩家能隨時隨地重懷過往三國旅程。<br><br>【遊戲特色】<br>■ 延續三國經典喚回你的熱血感動<br>超過百張地圖還原線上遊戲世界，知名歷史武魂再現三國群英，經典橫向捲軸玩法，體驗的不只是最初的回憶，還有熱血與感動。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321430/extras/2ab8bdb01c2fd38d4869a25ac44ab6b5.poster.avif?t=1784707314\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/232